WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:07.140
I have a very contrasting set of comments
from the other candidate to play for you.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.750
Joe Biden came out last night before Donald
Trump around 1:00 a.m., roughly in the morning

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.080
East Coast time.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.109
And he was notable in that he behaved like
a normal person.

00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:23.539
We didn't know at the time and we still don't
know now who is the winner of the race.

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:28.470
And Joe Biden doesn't come out like Trump
and say, I won.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:33.379
Joe Biden doesn't come out and say I won states
that haven't actually been called, which Donald

00:00:33.379 --> 00:00:34.379
Trump did.

00:00:34.379 --> 00:00:39.190
Joe Biden comes out and makes it clear we
knew it would take a while and we believe

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:41.280
we still have a path to winning, which is
true.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:45.920
He may not win, but as I showed you earlier,
earlier, in exquisite detail, he does have

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.920
a path.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.920
Here's Joe Biden.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.010
Your patience is commendable.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:53.120
We knew this was going to go wrong, but who
knew?

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.690
We're going to go into maybe tomorrow morning,
maybe even longer.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:02.410
But, look, we feel good about where we are.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.210
We really do.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:12.369
I'm here to tell you tonight we believe we're
on track to win this election, so, of course,

00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:18.460
Joe Biden is optimistic, as any campaign would
be until it's clear you're not going to win.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:22.119
But unlike Donald Trump, Joe Biden is being
a responsible adult.

00:01:22.119 --> 00:01:25.130
Joe Biden is not declaring a victory that
he doesn't have.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:29.960
Joe Biden is not declaring victories in states
that have not been called and which, in fact,

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.880
as Donald Trump said, we're winning Wisconsin
and Michigan.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.280
Those states flipped to Joseph R. Biden Jr.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:44.180
Notice that Joe Biden doesn't claim a victory
absent an actual victory to claim he doesn't

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:50.759
alleged fraud, abuse and actual fraud, to
claim he doesn't say he will go to court to

00:01:50.759 --> 00:01:54.189
try to stop ballots from being counted.

00:01:54.189 --> 00:01:55.710
The contrast is stunning.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.850
And the fact that so many Americans don't
care is a problem, which I am going to get

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.590
to a little bit later.

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:06.960
Increasingly, Joe Biden's path depends on
Pennsylvania, although as I said earlier,

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:13.310
even without it, Biden can win with Nevada,
Michigan and Wisconsin.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:15.360
But Joe Biden says they feel good about Pennsylvania.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.450
This was last night.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.920
We still have to see how the numbers come
in.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.880
But we're feeling good.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.970
We're feeling good about where we are.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:29.170
We believe one of the nets has suggested we've
already won Arizona, but we're confident about

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.170
Arizona.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.290
That's a turnaround.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:38.560
We're also just called in for Minnesota and
we're still in the game in Georgia, although

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.460
that's not what we expected.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:45.740
We're feeling good about Wisconsin and Michigan.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:59.060
And by the way, it's going to take time to
count the votes, we're going to win Pennsylvania.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:06.620
And as we will continue to see Pennsylvania,
if it were to flip back to Biden as that remaining

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:12.560
35 percent of the vote is counted, it could
be a huge part of Biden's path to victory.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:18.370
If indeed he gets it, it would be the ultimate
red mirage scenario, a major, major factor.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:22.980
And then lastly, here is Joe Biden saying
we could know the results as early as tomorrow

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:26.980
morning, but it is not up to him to say when
it is final.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:31.980
It is up to the American people and of course,
the people actually counting the ballots.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.980
Take a look at this.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:38.950
Look, you know, we could know the results
as early as tomorrow morning, but it may take

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:39.950
a little longer.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:45.200
As I've said all along, it's not my place
or Donald Trump's place to declare who's won

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.680
this election.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.240
That's the decision of the American people.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:52.790
But I'm optimistic about this outcome.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.820
I thank every one of you who came out and
vote in this election.

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:01.490
And by the way, Chris Coons and the Democrats,
congratulations here in Delaware.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.970
So the contrasts continue.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:08.870
If you thought with the wackiness would stop
on Election Day, you were very wrong.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:15.830
Joe Biden acting like a normal person connected
to reality, not a delusional narcissist.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.150
It's nice for a change.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:23.710
Donald Trump coming out in a rally like atmosphere,
claiming he won, claiming he won states in

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:30.259
which leads were evaporating literally as
he spoke, claiming fraud and claiming he will

00:04:30.259 --> 00:04:31.770
go to the Supreme Court.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.180
It's incredible, guys.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.889
It's incredible.

00:04:34.889 --> 00:04:39.729
We need to maintain our democratic systems.

00:04:39.729 --> 00:04:45.870
And Donald Trump is taking a sledgehammer
or a chef's knife or whatever, a sword, anything

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.819
Donald Trump could pick up with those hands
of his.

00:04:48.819 --> 00:04:53.270
And we need to protect democracy will continue
covering this on Instagram, where you can

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.539
find us at The David Pakman Show.

00:04:56.539 --> 00:05:39.939
Follow me on Instagram at David Pakman, The
David Pakman Show 

00:05:39.939 --> 00:06:46.559
at David Pakman dot com.

